  "notes": "Port census from the datasheet interface block: \"Ethernet (RJ45): No. of channels 16 (RJ45 ports), Transmission speed 10/100/1000 Mbps\"; no SFP and no combo interface is listed, so the whole box is copper. 85 mm wide, 435 g. Switch functions: MAC address table 8k, DHCP client / DHCP server (pool-based, port-based) / DHCP option 82, MRP client and manager, RSTP, alarm digital output 24 V DC. No PoE: the datasheet lists no PoE/PSE interface and no power budget for this model, so no poe-pse capability is declared. Management is in-band only - the datasheet interfaces block lists Ethernet (RJ45), Ethernet (SFP) and Ethernet (combo) and nothing else, so no serial/console port is modelled. The datasheet publishes no switching-capacity / fabric-bandwidth figure, so none is stated here. Sources: datasheet https://www.phoenixcontact.com/us/products/2702909?type=pdf ; product page https://www.phoenixcontact.com/us/products/2702909."
